From dc4e638eabe88f52eaf0fe594fdc6bf3a340e82e Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: OmniRoute Downstream <downstream@localhost>
Date: Wed, 28 Oct 2026 15:30:33 +0800
Subject: [PATCH] fix(authz): allow LAN clients through trusted proxies

Classify LOCAL_ONLY requests by independently attributed proxy clients without trusting a private proxy socket or client-IP fallback. Keep public and unattributed clients remote, preserve authentication and strictly direct loopback CLI tokens, and cover the boundary with HTTP regressions.
